 **Edge Cases and Pitfalls:**
 *   **Division by Zero:** If $v_1 = v_2$, the denominator is zero. The method must check $|v_2 - v_1| < eps$ and return an endpoint (typically $p_1$) [S2, S3, S4, unofficial].
